WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.412 --> 00:00:03.573
Danny: Where are we?

2
00:00:03.613 --> 00:00:05.695
Brad: There’s some sort of a cord here.

3
00:00:05.715 --> 00:00:07.036
Tina: That’s strange.

4
00:00:07.997 --> 00:00:08.558
We’re in a closet.

5
00:00:08.578 --> 00:00:32.285
Danny: I think I know where we are Danny: We’re back at school.

6
00:00:32.305 --> 00:00:35.047
Brad: And recess seems to be over.

7
00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:38.029
Tina: Maybe this has all been a dream.

8
00:00:38.049 --> 00:00:42.772
Brad: Nope.

9
00:00:43.452 --> 00:00:44.433
It wasn’t a dream.

10
00:00:48.856 --> 00:00:49.656
Bello, no!

11
00:00:49.676 --> 00:00:53.219
Danny: We’ve got to stop him.

12
00:00:53.239 --> 00:00:54.840
Brad: Forget that!

13
00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:56.361
We’ve got to hide him.

14
00:00:56.381 --> 00:00:57.882
Danny: Right!

15
00:00:59.563 --> 00:01:00.644
Where is everybody?

16
00:01:01.292 --> 00:01:03.213
Brad: They’re in class, lucky for us.

17
00:01:08.434 --> 00:01:09.974
How are we going to catch him?

18
00:01:09.994 --> 00:01:13.115
Danny: We’ve got to slow him down first.

19
00:01:13.135 --> 00:01:17.596
Brad: How do you slow down a runaway giant?

20
00:01:17.616 --> 00:01:19.737
Tina: I’ve got an idea!

21
00:01:19.757 --> 00:01:22.278
Danny: Well, let’s see it.

22
00:01:22.298 --> 00:01:25.578
Tina: Bello, stop!

23
00:01:28.479 --> 00:01:31.040
Bello: Stop.

24
00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:33.982
Danny: He listened to you!

25
00:01:34.002 --> 00:01:36.283
Tina: I know how to talk to babies.

26
00:01:36.303 --> 00:01:39.685
Tina: I have to babysit my little brother all the time.

27
00:01:39.705 --> 00:01:42.067
Brad: Well, that was easy.

28
00:01:42.087 --> 00:01:45.129
Tina: Bello, come here.

29
00:01:45.149 --> 00:01:46.970
Bello: Come.

30
00:01:46.990 --> 00:01:49.972
Danny: Wow!

31
00:01:50.333 --> 00:01:52.914
A giant who obeys your every command!

32
00:01:52.934 --> 00:01:55.596
Tina: Walk with me, Bello.

33
00:01:56.276 --> 00:01:57.577
It’s okay.

34
00:01:58.478 --> 00:02:00.799
Gently, Bello, gently.

35
00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:02.520
Bello: Gentle.

36
00:02:03.901 --> 00:02:04.301
Brad: Okay.

37
00:02:04.621 --> 00:02:05.861
Now we can go hide him.

38
00:02:05.881 --> 00:02:08.442
Tina: We need an empty room.

39
00:02:08.462 --> 00:02:10.442
Danny: The art room!

40
00:02:11.183 --> 00:02:12.523
No one will be in it now!

41
00:02:12.543 --> 00:02:14.144
Brad: That’s right.

42
00:02:14.164 --> 00:02:16.484
Danny: Wait!

43
00:02:16.824 --> 00:02:17.805
I hear footsteps.

44
00:02:18.485 --> 00:02:20.365
There’s somebody coming down the hall.

45
00:02:21.906 --> 00:02:27.027
Tina: Run, Bello, run!

46
00:02:27.047 --> 00:02:29.608
Brad: We can’t get caught now!

47
00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:33.158
Danny: We’d never get back to Ginormous if we did!

48
00:02:42.626 --> 00:02:43.626
I think he’s gone.

49
00:02:43.646 --> 00:02:45.688
Tina: That was close.

50
00:02:45.708 --> 00:02:46.949
Brad: Yeah.

51
00:02:47.469 --> 00:02:50.792
If we get caught, we'll have to wash blackboards for a year.

52
00:02:50.812 --> 00:02:52.994
Bello: Boo!
